{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41612","headline":"晚秋同何秀才溪上 · 伍乔","name":"晚秋同何秀才溪上","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闲步秋光思杳然，荷藜因共过林烟。\n期收野药寻幽路，欲采溪菱上小船。\n云吐晚阴藏霁岫，柳含余霭咽残蝉。\n倒尊尽日忘归处，山磬数声敲暝天。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"伍乔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41612.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41612","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}